{"id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-model.md","title":"Model","display":"df-model — Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-model","aliases":["58-df-model","Model"],"display":"df-model — Model","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-model</span><span>Model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-model — Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b00c32fa4e76ff85\" href=\"?note=b00c32fa4e76ff85\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M,T,S_0\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathcal M,T,S_0\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b00c32fa4e76ff85\" href=\"?note=b00c32fa4e76ff85\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-model6-sentence-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists S_0,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)\\land T\\subseteq S_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}model}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathcal M,T,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists S_0,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel6SentenceSet}_S(\\mathcal L,S_0)\\land T\\subseteq S_0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\forall s\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s))\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Model: structure satisfying a theory; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} \\models T\">\\(\\mathcal{M} \\models T\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> true in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Elementary submodel: all first-order truths preserved; stronger than substructure</li>\n<li>Completeness: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> complete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iff\">\\(\\iff\\)</span> all models of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> are elementarily equivalent</li>\n<li>Compactness: finitely satisfiable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\implies\">\\(\\implies\\)</span> satisfiable; non-constructive proof via ultraproducts</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Hodges, A Shorter Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Re